    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/37f700b71e109bc14d53cff2298db07d.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the time of the Black Blaze, a mysterious dust storm that has turned the farmlands into barren wastelands abandoned by mankind. Only one hare hero stands between utter desolation and survival: Captain Rabbo Sunskipper, a daring pilot leading a rag-tag outfit on a mission of seeding, watering, and cultivating crops in the face of utter disaster... And the atrocious avian goons of the Gale Gang! Join the ranks of the Air Hares in their feats of fearless flying and turn Winrose Warren into a thriving community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strap In!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/356bf0c8e5b3fd76dd9f6ece9b8744d6.poster.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/356bf0c8e5b3fd76dd9f6ece9b8744d6.webm?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/356bf0c8e5b3fd76dd9f6ece9b8744d6.mp4?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a clever twist on the bullet hell formula, your goal isn\u2019t blasting enemies out of the air! With Winrose Warren on the brink of starvation, your objective is to make sure the carrot fields yield as much harvest as possible. How? With your little plane, loaded to the brim with seeds and water\u2013perfect to turn barren belts into fertile fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the Skies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/3b33cd1b122fdccd7de5caac71c34730.poster.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/3b33cd1b122fdccd7de5caac71c34730.webm?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/3b33cd1b122fdccd7de5caac71c34730.mp4?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But there's more than just seeding and watering! As Captain Rabbo and her indomitable sidekick, Dirk Doggo, you\u2019ll face wave upon wave of atrocious avian aggressors from the gluttonous Gale Gang! They fight to keep the land in a state of perpetual misery and desolation. Dodge, jab, and ram these formidable fowl, showing them that no matter what they try, your will to restore the landscape remains unbroken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the Land!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/8b5e0e3187f54a5e833c76d797e28ed6.poster.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/8b5e0e3187f54a5e833c76d797e28ed6.webm?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/8b5e0e3187f54a5e833c76d797e28ed6.mp4?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, Winrose will grow from a desolate warren into a bustling metropolis under Captain Robbo! Keep fighting off the Gale Gang, farming your crops, and attracting new recruits to the Air Hares. But beware: as you transform this fledging warren into a bountiful borough, you'll eventually confront the mighty Twin Horn in a battle that will decide the fate of all bunkind!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/37f700b71e109bc14d53cff2298db07d.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the time of the Black Blaze, a mysterious dust storm that has turned the farmlands into barren wastelands abandoned by mankind. Only one hare hero stands between utter desolation and survival: Captain Rabbo Sunskipper, a daring pilot leading a rag-tag outfit on a mission of seeding, watering, and cultivating crops in the face of utter disaster... And the atrocious avian goons of the Gale Gang! Join the ranks of the Air Hares in their feats of fearless flying and turn Winrose Warren into a thriving community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strap In!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/356bf0c8e5b3fd76dd9f6ece9b8744d6.poster.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/356bf0c8e5b3fd76dd9f6ece9b8744d6.webm?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/356bf0c8e5b3fd76dd9f6ece9b8744d6.mp4?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a clever twist on the bullet hell formula, your goal isn\u2019t blasting enemies out of the air! With Winrose Warren on the brink of starvation, your objective is to make sure the carrot fields yield as much harvest as possible. How? With your little plane, loaded to the brim with seeds and water\u2013perfect to turn barren belts into fertile fields!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the Skies!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/3b33cd1b122fdccd7de5caac71c34730.poster.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/3b33cd1b122fdccd7de5caac71c34730.webm?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/3b33cd1b122fdccd7de5caac71c34730.mp4?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>But there's more than just seeding and watering! As Captain Rabbo and her indomitable sidekick, Dirk Doggo, you\u2019ll face wave upon wave of atrocious avian aggressors from the gluttonous Gale Gang! They fight to keep the land in a state of perpetual misery and desolation. Dodge, jab, and ram these formidable fowl, showing them that no matter what they try, your will to restore the landscape remains unbroken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Restore the Land!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/8b5e0e3187f54a5e833c76d797e28ed6.poster.avif?t=1755201358\" width=616 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/8b5e0e3187f54a5e833c76d797e28ed6.webm?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544390/extras/8b5e0e3187f54a5e833c76d797e28ed6.mp4?t=1755201358\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, Winrose will grow from a desolate warren into a bustling metropolis under Captain Robbo! Keep fighting off the Gale Gang, farming your crops, and attracting new recruits to the Air Hares. But beware: as you transform this fledging warren into a bountiful borough, you'll eventually confront the mighty Twin Horn in a battle that will decide the fate of all bunkind!</p>",
    "short_description": "Join the intrepid bunny pilot, Captain Rabbo, and her crew of fluffy flyers as they fight to turn the barren Winrose Warren into a blossoming landscape! Become an Air Hare in a unique take on bullet hells, restoring farmland one seed at a time, against the nefarious Gale Gang goons!",
